OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable cloud through the day
OL,6,Fwith a few light showers developing
OL,7,Fmainly across Norfolk, but still some
OL,8,Fbright spells expected. Any showers
OL,9,Fmostly fading later. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage and occasionally breezy at
OL,11,Ftimes.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining largely dry with
OL,14,Fcloud breaking to give some clear
OL,15,Fspells. Turning cold with frost
OL,16,Fdeveloping inland and a few mist or
OL,17,Ffog patches possible. Chance of an
OL,18,Fisolated shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
