OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAny early mist or fog
OL,6,Fclearing, then a largely dry day with
OL,7,Fvariable cloud and some sunny spells.
OL,8,FRemaining rather chilly with generally
OL,9,Flight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FTurning cloudier Tuesday, with rain
OL,13,Fpossible later. Generally cloudy and
OL,14,Fchilly Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,15,Fpatchy rain possible, especially for
OL,16,FWednesday. Temperatures near or just
OL,17,Fbelow average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
